	(text "Compute-rail power: monitored MAIN_5V -> fuse+TVS -> TPS25940 eFuse (P4 EN) -> 25m shunt + INA238 -> M2_5V"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 78.74 0)
		(effects (font (size 2 2) (thickness 0.35) (bold yes) (color 26 95 180 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "d0202bc9-ac47-48f8-b300-2e25854a43ba")
	)
	(text "K1 row 8: the AX630C's draw is a locally MEASURED signature (INA238 @ 0x40,\nALERT -> P4). M2_PWR_EN pulled LOW = compute OFF by default (13.4 STANDBY\nposture: P4 trust endpoint lives on RJ-45 5VSB, compute rail on MAIN_5V, S0\nonly). Design point ~1A avg / 2A fuse+ILIM; 6x 5V-VIN fingers on 09.\nTPS25940 app values ILLUSTRATIVE (flag F6): ILIM/dVdT/PGTH/OVP-to-GND all\npend datasheet sizing. Assume-bad actuation: P4 can hard power-cycle the\nmodule into a freshly-measured state at any time (C2 row 14)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 106.68 187.96 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (color 21 96 61 1)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "800c9776-1e39-4aba-9d18-480d807b0793")
	)
